### Create single log (API key)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/v1/log
Authorization: Bearer ast_YOUR_API_KEY
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "openai",
  "model": "gpt-4",
  "tokens": 1500,
  "cost": 0.045,
  "metadata": {
    "userId": "user123",
    "feature": "chatbot"
  }
}

### Create batch logs (API key)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/v1/log/batch
Authorization: Bearer ast_YOUR_API_KEY
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "provider": "openai",
    "model": "gpt-3.5-turbo",
    "tokens": 500,
    "cost": 0.001,
    "metadata": { "feature": "summarizer" }
  },
  {
    "provider": "anthropic",
    "model": "claude-3-sonnet",
    "tokens": 2000,
    "cost": 0.012,
    "metadata": { "feature": "chatbot" }
  }
]

### Get overview stats (JWT)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/v1/stats/overview
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

### Get daily stats (JWT)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/v1/stats/daily?days=7
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

### Get provider breakdown (JWT)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/v1/stats/by-provider
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

### Get model breakdown (JWT)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/v1/stats/by-model
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

